OL,3,GNEWSAAbuser threatened to make victim's
OL,4,Alife 'hell'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA domestic abuser who threatened to
OL,7,Fmake his victim's life "hell" if she
OL,8,Fdid not withdraw her evidence to police
OL,9,Fhas been jailed for two and a half
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FReece Sweet, 23, subjected the woman to
OL,13,Fvarious forms of abuse before
OL,14,Fstrangling and punching her, Newcastle
OL,15,FCrown Court heard.
OL,17,FHe then bombarded her with threats to
OL,18,Fdrop her support for the prosecution,
OL,19,Fwith the woman genuinely fearing he
OL,20,Fwould harm her, Judge Gavin Doig said.
