OL,5,
OL,6,FSweet, from Gateshead, who is already
OL,7,Fserving three years and eight months
OL,8,Ffor false imprisonment and assault of
OL,9,Fanother woman, admitted assault,
OL,10,Fintentional strangulation and witness
OL,11,Fintimidation.
